# Invoices

Inherits `use: [no_autodiscovery]` from [[index|the billing folder note]], so
every name below resolves through an import or the spine — nothing is found by
sweeping the tree.

## Dependencies

- `[[retry-policy]]` → `shared/retry-policy.hmd`, via the **wildcard import**
  `/shared`. The directory joins this card's search path; it is not eagerly
  bound, so a card added to `shared/` later becomes reachable here with no edit
  to this header.
- `[[login-spec]]` → `specs/auth/login.hmd`, via a **relative named import**.
  `../auth` is resolved from this card's own directory.

## Retries

A failed charge is retried on the shared schedule:

![[retry-policy#^backoff-formula]]

Payment retries additionally stop at the invoice due date, whichever comes
first. ^retry-deadline

## Escalation

A charge that exhausts its retry budget escalates to a re-authentication prompt,
specified in [[login-spec#Flow]].
